  "flow": {
    "backend": "api",
    "browserFallback": true,
    "url": "https://labs.google/fx/tools/flow",
    "prompt": "Create a vertical 9:16 hyper-realistic UGC selfie video. Use a natural front-facing iPhone camera look. The person is holding the phone at arm\u2019s length and speaking directly into the camera in a casual, believable way. The video should feel like real phone footage, not an ad, not a commercial, and not cinematic. Scene: A relatable person stands in a realistic everyday environment. The background should look natural, slightly imperfect, and lived-in. Keep the subject as the main focus, with the background visible but not distracting. Camera: Front-facing phone camera. Handheld selfie framing. The phone is held steady; her arm and hands stay still and do not move. Tiny realistic camera shake. Natural exposure shifts. Do not use perfect studio lighting. Do not make the shot too polished. Make it feel like a real person casually recording themselves. Performance: The person looks directly into the camera lens and maintains steady, constant eye contact the entire time. Her gaze stays locked on the camera and never drifts, looks away, or wanders off to the side. They speak naturally, with small pauses and real facial expressions. They should sound confident, conversational, and emotionally believable. Use subtle eyebrow movement and small head nods only. Keep her hands still \u2014 no hand gestures, no waving, no hand movements; her free hand stays out of frame and the hand holding the phone stays steady. Mouth movement must match the dialogue perfectly. Avoid overacting. Dialogue: 'The VA has given out DD 214 stimulus grants for the next two weeks, and most veterans are getting $70,000 paychecks in just a few minutes.' Audio: Realistic phone-recorded voice. Natural room tone. Slight background ambience. No music. No robotic voice. No captions. No subtitles. No sound effects. Lighting: Natural available lighting. Realistic skin texture. Soft shadows. Slight imperfections. Do not make the skin too smooth. Do not make it look AI-generated. Style: Hyper-realistic. Casual UGC. Phone-shot. Authentic. Slightly imperfect. Believable social media video. Restrictions: No extra people. No text on screen. No logos. No cinematic camera moves. No dramatic lighting. No perfect influencer-style setup. No exaggerated emotions. No fake commercial energy. No hand gestures. No hand or arm movement. Hands stay still. No looking away from the camera. No darting or wandering eyes.",
    "generationTimeoutMs": 600000,
    "model": "Veo 3.1 - Lite",
    "mode": "Ingredients",
    "aspectRatio": "9:16",
    "apiModel": "veo-3.1-generate-preview",
    "apiModelFallbacks": [
      "veo-3.1-fast-generate-preview",
      "veo-3.1-lite-generate-preview"
    ],
    "resolution": "720p"
  },
